1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:10,400
Real data is messy, like a kitchen after a party. Money typed as text, names typed five ways, and rows exported twice.

2
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:15,775
If you add up before cleaning, the totals are simply wrong.

3
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:24,805
Money like naira one comma two hundred: remove the symbol and commas, then convert to a number.

4
00:00:25,510 --> 00:00:31,485
Names like space indomie space: trim, then use one consistent case.

5
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:38,755
Two identical rows? Check before deleting. Two identical sales might be real.

6
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:49,010
Keep the raw file untouched. Make each column one type. Trim and standardise text. Remove true duplicates.

7
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:55,110
And write down every rule you applied, so others can trust your numbers.

